{
  "sourceCommit": "31be8fa4a9d8af3405895de694950d20d027e6d5",
  "html": "<div id=\"readme\" class=\"md\" data-path=\"README.md\"><article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Mage-OS EAV Debug Views</h1><a id=\"user-content-mage-os-eav-debug-views\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Mage-OS EAV Debug Views\" href=\"#mage-os-eav-debug-views\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Developer utility module for Magento 2.4.x that creates database views aggregating EAV entity data with attribute values in JSON format.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-important\" dir=\"auto\"><p class=\"markdown-alert-title\" dir=\"auto\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-report mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 1.75C0 .784.784 0 1.75 0h12.5C15.216 0 16 .784 16 1.75v9.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.25 13H8.06l-2.573 2.573A1.458 1.458 0 0 1 3 14.543V13H1.75A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25Zm1.75-.25a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v9.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h2a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.19l2.72-2.72a.749.749 0 0 1 .53-.22h6.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-9.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25Zm7 2.25v2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0ZM9 9a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z\"></path></svg>Important</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>This module is designed for development and debugging.</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">While production-installable, consider these factors:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Database views may impact performance on large datasets</li>\n<li>JSON aggregation is resource-intensive for complex queries</li>\n<li>Intended for temporary debugging, not permanent production use</li>\n<li>No query optimization beyond entity_id lookups</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Suggested Use:</strong> Install in development/staging only. Do not write code that would use these views on a live site.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Requirements</h2><a id=\"user-content-requirements\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Requirements\" href=\"#requirements\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Magento:</strong> 2.4.x</li>\n<li><strong>PHP:</strong> 8.1+</li>\n<li><strong>Database:</strong> MySQL 5.7+ or MariaDB 10.2.3+\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Requires MySQL <code>JSON</code> function support</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Installation</h2><a id=\"user-content-installation\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Installation\" href=\"#installation\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"composer require --dev mage-os/module-eav-debug-views\nbin/magento setup:upgrade\"><pre>composer require --dev mage-os/module-eav-debug-views\nbin/magento setup:upgrade</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Created Views</h2><a id=\"user-content-created-views\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Created Views\" href=\"#created-views\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">1. dev_product</h3><a id=\"user-content-1-dev_product\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 1. dev_product\" href=\"#1-dev_product\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Combines <code>catalog_product_entity</code> with all EAV attributes aggregated as JSON.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Columns:</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>All <code>catalog_product_entity</code> columns (entity_id, sku, type_id, etc.)</li>\n<li><code>eav_attributes</code> (JSON) - All EAV attribute values from decimal, datetime, int, text, varchar tables</li>\n</ul>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/13335952/521504442-722bdd36-0d0c-4ee8-b586-baaec3927c70.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..lJ70F58XG6TdPau99nGg0cqvpVFA5N26wkYOm71hN2E\"><img width=\"972\" height=\"230\" alt=\"2025-12-02_134111\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/13335952/521504442-722bdd36-0d0c-4ee8-b586-baaec3927c70.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..lJ70F58XG6TdPau99nGg0cqvpVFA5N26wkYOm71hN2E\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 230px;; aspect-ratio: 972 / 230; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Example Query:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-sql notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"SELECT\n    entity_id,\n    sku,\n    type_id,\n    JSON_PRETTY(eav_attributes) as attributes\nFROM dev_product\nWHERE sku = 'my-product-sku';\"><pre><span class=\"pl-k\">SELECT</span>\n    entity_id,\n    sku,\n    type_id,\n    JSON_PRETTY(eav_attributes) <span class=\"pl-k\">as</span> attributes\n<span class=\"pl-k\">FROM</span> dev_product\n<span class=\"pl-k\">WHERE</span> sku <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>my-product-sku<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>;</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Extract Specific Attributes:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-sql notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"SELECT\n    entity_id,\n    sku,\n    JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, '$.name') as name,\n    JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, '$.price') as price,\n    JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, '$.status') as status\nFROM dev_product\nWHERE entity_id = 1;\"><pre><span class=\"pl-k\">SELECT</span>\n    entity_id,\n    sku,\n    JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>$.name<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>) <span class=\"pl-k\">as</span> name,\n    JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>$.price<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>) <span class=\"pl-k\">as</span> price,\n    JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>$.status<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>) <span class=\"pl-k\">as</span> status\n<span class=\"pl-k\">FROM</span> dev_product\n<span class=\"pl-k\">WHERE</span> entity_id <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">1</span>;</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">2. dev_category</h3><a id=\"user-content-2-dev_category\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 2. dev_category\" href=\"#2-dev_category\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Combines <code>catalog_category_entity</code> with EAV attributes.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Columns:</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>All <code>catalog_category_entity</code> columns (entity_id, path, level, etc.)</li>\n<li><code>eav_attributes</code> (JSON) - All EAV attribute values from decimal, datetime, int, text, varchar tables</li>\n</ul>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/13335952/521503383-4b18f9bc-5785-416d-8f87-cbba207a6f60.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.._LEmRS-oDHpqVyw8EHwlptfmuw3SH2pIOQaSZlk5bjg\"><img width=\"942\" height=\"230\" alt=\"2025-12-02_133915\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/13335952/521503383-4b18f9bc-5785-416d-8f87-cbba207a6f60.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.._LEmRS-oDHpqVyw8EHwlptfmuw3SH2pIOQaSZlk5bjg\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 230px;; aspect-ratio: 942 / 230; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Example Query:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-sql notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"SELECT\n    entity_id,\n    parent_id,\n    path,\n    level,\n    JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, '$.name') as name,\n    JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, '$.is_active') as is_active\nFROM dev_category\nWHERE level = 2;\"><pre><span class=\"pl-k\">SELECT</span>\n    entity_id,\n    parent_id,\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">path</span>,\n    level,\n    JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>$.name<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>) <span class=\"pl-k\">as</span> name,\n    JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>$.is_active<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>) <span class=\"pl-k\">as</span> is_active\n<span class=\"pl-k\">FROM</span> dev_category\n<span class=\"pl-k\">WHERE</span> level <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">2</span>;</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">3. dev_customer</h3><a id=\"user-content-3-dev_customer\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 3. dev_customer\" href=\"#3-dev_customer\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Combines <code>customer_entity</code> with EAV attributes.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Columns:</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>All <code>customer_entity</code> columns (entity_id, firstname, lastname, email, etc.)</li>\n<li><code>eav_attributes</code> (JSON) - All EAV attribute values from decimal, datetime, int, text, varchar tables</li>\n</ul>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/13335952/521502856-6edaa2ab-71fa-4abf-b85b-aec1cbd27c7e.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..PBn77JpLluug_VCSooFfBYRUQkeKkIbxBCx29OXn1M8\"><img width=\"1614\" height=\"121\" alt=\"2025-12-02_133737\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/13335952/521502856-6edaa2ab-71fa-4abf-b85b-aec1cbd27c7e.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..PBn77JpLluug_VCSooFfBYRUQkeKkIbxBCx29OXn1M8\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 121px;; aspect-ratio: 1614 / 121; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Example Query:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-sql notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"SELECT\n    entity_id,\n    email,\n    firstname,\n    lastname,\n    JSON_PRETTY(eav_attributes) as custom_attributes\nFROM dev_customer\nWHERE email LIKE '%@example.com';\"><pre><span class=\"pl-k\">SELECT</span>\n    entity_id,\n    email,\n    firstname,\n    lastname,\n    JSON_PRETTY(eav_attributes) <span class=\"pl-k\">as</span> custom_attributes\n<span class=\"pl-k\">FROM</span> dev_customer\n<span class=\"pl-k\">WHERE</span> email <span class=\"pl-k\">LIKE</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>%@example.com<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>;</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">4. dev_address</h3><a id=\"user-content-4-dev_address\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 4. dev_address\" href=\"#4-dev_address\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Combines <code>customer_address_entity</code> with EAV attributes.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Columns:</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>All <code>customer_address_entity</code> columns (entity_id, firstname, lastname, street, city, etc.)</li>\n<li><code>eav_attributes</code> (JSON) - All EAV attribute values from decimal, datetime, int, text, varchar tables</li>\n</ul>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/13335952/521503789-8e06aa3b-0705-4d44-b251-99faa8157b47.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..SFXVTlIo7aPndYKMKwp1v1ctg-IknlqXoTVKr_LjvSE\"><img width=\"1350\" height=\"100\" alt=\"2025-12-02_134001\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/13335952/521503789-8e06aa3b-0705-4d44-b251-99faa8157b47.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..SFXVTlIo7aPndYKMKwp1v1ctg-IknlqXoTVKr_LjvSE\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 100px;; aspect-ratio: 1350 / 100; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Example Query:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-sql notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"SELECT\n    entity_id,\n    parent_id,\n    city,\n    country_id,\n    JSON_PRETTY(eav_attributes) as custom_attributes\nFROM dev_address\nWHERE parent_id = 1;\"><pre><span class=\"pl-k\">SELECT</span>\n    entity_id,\n    parent_id,\n    city,\n    country_id,\n    JSON_PRETTY(eav_attributes) <span class=\"pl-k\">as</span> custom_attributes\n<span class=\"pl-k\">FROM</span> dev_address\n<span class=\"pl-k\">WHERE</span> parent_id <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">1</span>;</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">5. dev_product_attribute</h3><a id=\"user-content-5-dev_product_attribute\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 5. dev_product_attribute\" href=\"#5-dev_product_attribute\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Quick reference for product attribute metadata.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Columns:</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>All <code>eav_attribute</code> columns (attribute_id, attribute_code, etc.)</li>\n<li>All <code>catalog_eav_attribute</code> columns (is_searchable, is_filterable, used_in_product_listing, etc.)</li>\n<li><code>attribute_sets</code> (JSON) - All attribute sets and groups the attribute is assigned to, including IDs, names, and sort order.</li>\n<li><em>@TODO: Add <code>eav_options</code> with all option IDs and values for DB-stored <code>select</code> and <code>multiselect</code>-type attributes.</em></li>\n</ul>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/13335952/521505566-aaa3c3bc-917a-4fbf-8e7a-f6eefb9bc4e1.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..91HCo-87Y36OfBM0t7loSpn-KFLsEJ4Gp90QMiYYF2I\"><img width=\"1167\" height=\"163\" alt=\"2025-12-02_134337\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/13335952/521505566-aaa3c3bc-917a-4fbf-8e7a-f6eefb9bc4e1.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..91HCo-87Y36OfBM0t7loSpn-KFLsEJ4Gp90QMiYYF2I\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 163px;; aspect-ratio: 1167 / 163; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Example Query:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-sql notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"SELECT\n    attribute_id,\n    attribute_code,\n    backend_type,\n    frontend_input,\n    is_filterable,\n    is_searchable,\n    position,\n    attribute_sets\nFROM dev_product_attribute\nWHERE is_filterable=1\nORDER BY attribute_code;\"><pre><span class=\"pl-k\">SELECT</span>\n    attribute_id,\n    attribute_code,\n    backend_type,\n    frontend_input,\n    is_filterable,\n    is_searchable,\n    position,\n    attribute_sets\n<span class=\"pl-k\">FROM</span> dev_product_attribute\n<span class=\"pl-k\">WHERE</span> is_filterable<span class=\"pl-k\">=</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">1</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">ORDER BY</span> attribute_code;</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Store Scope</h2><a id=\"user-content-store-scope\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Store Scope\" href=\"#store-scope\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">All EAV views aggregate <strong>all store_id values</strong> into a single JSON object per entity.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Store-specific attribute keys</strong> use the format <code>attribute_code:store_id</code> (e.g., <code>name:1</code>, <code>name:2</code>).\n<strong>Global attributes</strong> (store_id = 0) use just the <code>attribute_code</code> (e.g., <code>name</code>, <code>sku</code>).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Example - Querying store-specific values:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-sql notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"-- Get product with global and store-specific names\nSELECT\n    entity_id,\n    sku,\n    JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, '$.name') as global_name,\n    JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, '$.\\&quot;name:1\\&quot;') as store_1_name,\n    JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, '$.\\&quot;name:2\\&quot;') as store_2_name\nFROM dev_product\nWHERE sku = 'my-product';\n\n-- See all attribute values including store-specific\nSELECT\n    entity_id,\n    sku,\n    JSON_PRETTY(eav_attributes) as all_attributes\nFROM dev_product\nWHERE entity_id = 1;\"><pre><span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">--</span> Get product with global and store-specific names</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">SELECT</span>\n    entity_id,\n    sku,\n    JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>$.name<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>) <span class=\"pl-k\">as</span> global_name,\n    JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>$.<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\"</span>name:1<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>) <span class=\"pl-k\">as</span> store_1_name,\n    JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>$.<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\"</span>name:2<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>) <span class=\"pl-k\">as</span> store_2_name\n<span class=\"pl-k\">FROM</span> dev_product\n<span class=\"pl-k\">WHERE</span> sku <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>my-product<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>;\n\n<span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">--</span> See all attribute values including store-specific</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">SELECT</span>\n    entity_id,\n    sku,\n    JSON_PRETTY(eav_attributes) <span class=\"pl-k\">as</span> all_attributes\n<span class=\"pl-k\">FROM</span> dev_product\n<span class=\"pl-k\">WHERE</span> entity_id <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">1</span>;</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For technical reasons, we can't sort attributes alphabetically. Scoped values for an attribute may appear anywhere within the JSON. (MySQL does not support sorting values within <code>JSON_OBJECTAGG(...)</code> in <code>ONLY_FULL_GROUP_BY</code> mode.)</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Performance Considerations</h2><a id=\"user-content-performance-considerations\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Performance Considerations\" href=\"#performance-considerations\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Query Optimization</h3><a id=\"user-content-query-optimization\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Query Optimization\" href=\"#query-optimization\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">If filtering by attribute values, be careful about the amount of records processed.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Fast:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-sql notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"-- Uses entity table index\nSELECT * FROM dev_product WHERE entity_id = 123;\nSELECT * FROM dev_product WHERE sku = 'ABC123';\"><pre><span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">--</span> Uses entity table index</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">SELECT</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">*</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">FROM</span> dev_product <span class=\"pl-k\">WHERE</span> entity_id <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">123</span>;\n<span class=\"pl-k\">SELECT</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">*</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">FROM</span> dev_product <span class=\"pl-k\">WHERE</span> sku <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>ABC123<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>;</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Not fast:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-sql notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"-- Full table scan with JSON parsing\nSELECT * FROM dev_product\nWHERE JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, '$.status') = 1;\"><pre><span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">--</span> Full table scan with JSON parsing</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">SELECT</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">*</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">FROM</span> dev_product\n<span class=\"pl-k\">WHERE</span> JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>$.status<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>) <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">1</span>;</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">View Characteristics</h3><a id=\"user-content-view-characteristics\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: View Characteristics\" href=\"#view-characteristics\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>NOT materialized</strong> - Data is queried live from base tables</li>\n<li><strong>NOT indexed</strong> - Uses base table indexes via entity_id</li>\n<li><strong>CTE overhead</strong> - 5 subqueries per entity type</li>\n<li><strong>JSON aggregation</strong> - Processing cost on SELECT</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Recommendation:</strong> Use for ad-hoc debugging queries, not high-frequency production queries.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Uninstallation</h2><a id=\"user-content-uninstallation\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Uninstallation\" href=\"#uninstallation\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"bin/magento module:uninstall MageOS_EavDebugViews --remove-data\"><pre>bin/magento module:uninstall MageOS_EavDebugViews --remove-data</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This command:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Drops all module views from the database</li>\n<li>Removes module from <code>setup_module</code> table</li>\n<li>Removes module code (if installed via composer)</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Use Cases</h2><a id=\"user-content-use-cases\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Use Cases\" href=\"#use-cases\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Quick Product Debugging</h3><a id=\"user-content-quick-product-debugging\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Quick Product Debugging\" href=\"#quick-product-debugging\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-sql notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"-- See all attributes for a specific product\nSELECT entity_id, sku, JSON_PRETTY(eav_attributes)\nFROM dev_product\nWHERE sku = 'problematic-sku';\"><pre><span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">--</span> See all attributes for a specific product</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">SELECT</span> entity_id, sku, JSON_PRETTY(eav_attributes)\n<span class=\"pl-k\">FROM</span> dev_product\n<span class=\"pl-k\">WHERE</span> sku <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>problematic-sku<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>;</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Find Products with Specific Attribute Values</h3><a id=\"user-content-find-products-with-specific-attribute-values\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Find Products with Specific Attribute Values\" href=\"#find-products-with-specific-attribute-values\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-sql notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"-- Find disabled products\nSELECT entity_id, sku,\n       JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, '$.status') as status\nFROM dev_product\nHAVING status = 2;\"><pre><span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">--</span> Find disabled products</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">SELECT</span> entity_id, sku,\n       JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>$.status<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>) <span class=\"pl-k\">as</span> status\n<span class=\"pl-k\">FROM</span> dev_product\n<span class=\"pl-k\">HAVING</span> status <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">2</span>;</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Attribute Discovery</h3><a id=\"user-content-attribute-discovery\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Attribute Discovery\" href=\"#attribute-discovery\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-sql notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"-- What custom attributes exist for products?\nSELECT attribute_code, frontend_input, is_required\nFROM dev_product_attribute\nWHERE is_user_defined = 1;\"><pre><span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">--</span> What custom attributes exist for products?</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">SELECT</span> attribute_code, frontend_input, is_required\n<span class=\"pl-k\">FROM</span> dev_product_attribute\n<span class=\"pl-k\">WHERE</span> is_user_defined <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">1</span>;</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Category Hierarchy Analysis</h3><a id=\"user-content-category-hierarchy-analysis\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Category Hierarchy Analysis\" href=\"#category-hierarchy-analysis\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-sql notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"-- View category tree with names\nSELECT\n    entity_id,\n    level,\n    path,\n    JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, '$.name') as name,\n    JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, '$.is_active') as active\nFROM dev_category\nWHERE level BETWEEN 1 AND 3\nORDER BY path;\"><pre><span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">--</span> View category tree with names</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">SELECT</span>\n    entity_id,\n    level,\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">path</span>,\n    JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>$.name<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>) <span class=\"pl-k\">as</span> name,\n    JSON_EXTRACT(eav_attributes, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>$.is_active<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>) <span class=\"pl-k\">as</span> active\n<span class=\"pl-k\">FROM</span> dev_category\n<span class=\"pl-k\">WHERE</span> level BETWEEN <span class=\"pl-c1\">1</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">AND</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">3</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">ORDER BY</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">path</span>;</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">License</h2><a id=\"user-content-license\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: License\" href=\"#license\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Open Software License (OSL-3.0)</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Contributing</h2><a id=\"user-content-contributing\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Contributing\" href=\"#contributing\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-